    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_home_a_04",
      "hash64": "747FBA5472A90186",
      "text": "Indeed. People from all over have been talking\\nabout how strong of a battler you are and the\\r\\namazing Pokémon you take along with you.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
